Z||000002||Old Lar||06-26-2000||08:20 PM||||A real easy theft deterrent:  remove the coil wire from the distributor.  The car will crank, but no juice.  I don't think many joy riding car thiefs would be carrying around a extra coil wire.||||reg||1
