Z||000009||86SE||06-27-2000||12:37 AM||||Changing coil wires and sparkplug wires, you have to got out and pop the hood and get your hands dirty.  Taking out the fuse would not be good, you could loose it, or if it was a smart car theve, he would check the fuse.<P>A switch, all you have to do is flip it as you go out, flip it back when you get in.  Nothing in the car would look out of place, and deffinently nothing would look out of place under the hood.<P>I like the Ford floor switch to turn off the starter........ <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||12
