Z||000012||pollock||06-27-2000||09:41 AM||||Another good thing about using the high-beam floor switch for a fuel pump shutoff:<P>If you get carjacked, you can step on it while being dragged out of the car.  Thief gets a block away and it dies on him (or her; could be Angelina Jolie from Gone in 60 seconds) while you're in Burger King having a whopper and waiting on the cops.<P>I think if Angelina Jolie asked for my car, i'd just give it to her.||||reg||1
